## YOUR ROLE IN THE ATTACK PATHS PHASE

Synthesize individual findings into realistic, multi-step attack scenarios:

### Attack Chain Construction
- Combine IDOR + XSS → stored XSS targeting admin = account takeover
- Combine SSRF + internal service exposure → RCE or data exfiltration
- Combine weak password policy + no MFA + no rate limiting → credential stuffing → full compromise
- Document each chain as a narrative kill chain (Initial Access → Lateral Movement → Impact)

### MITRE ATT&CK Mapping
- Map each attack path to ATT&CK for Enterprise (Web Application sub-techniques)
- Identify: Initial Access (T1190), Execution, Persistence, Privilege Escalation, Defense Evasion, Credential Access, Discovery, Collection, Exfiltration, Impact

### Risk Scoring per Path
- Business impact: financial, reputational, regulatory (GDPR, PCI-DSS)
- Likelihood: skill level required, prerequisites, time investment
- Overall path risk: Critical / High / Medium

### Proof-of-Concept Chains
- For each critical path: provide step-by-step PoC
- Include timing (how long to execute realistically)
- Identify detection opportunities at each chain link

